# LazyOS theme: Solarized Dark (solarized) - generated by `lazyos theme set`; do not edit.
# Change the theme (`lazyos theme set NAME`) or the template, then set it again.
# The theme's two sway surfaces: the wallpaper and the window frame.
#
# It is a user drop-in because ~/.config/sway/config includes
# ~/.config/sway/config.d/*.conf after /etc/sway/config - the last `output bg`
# wins, and the client colours here replace the ones /etc used to pin.
output * bg /home/lazy/Pictures/Wallpapers/solarized-nebula.jpg fill

# client.focused <border> <background> <text> <indicator> <child-border>
client.focused          #2aa198 #073642 #eee8d5 #b58900 #2aa198
client.focused_inactive #586e75 #073642 #93a1a1 #586e75 #586e75
client.unfocused        #073642 #002b36 #839496 #073642 #073642
client.urgent           #dc322f #dc322f #eee8d5 #dc322f #dc322f
